\textbf{Method} & \textbf{Seed 42} & \textbf{Seed 123} & \textbf{Seed 456} & \textbf{Mean} \\
\midrule
Uniform                & 17.694 & 17.686 & 17.702 & 17.697 $\pm$ .008 \\
Adaptive $\bstar$ (ours) & \textbf{17.680} & \textbf{17.666} & \textbf{17.677} & \textbf{17.674} $\pm$ .006 \\
